WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.920 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

02:09.730 --> 02:12.230
Fin, I'm here!

02:20.200 --> 02:21.990
The castle doesn't have an entrance!

02:21.990 --> 02:24.490
How are we supposed to get in?!

02:24.490 --> 02:27.120
Access, aren't you forgetting something?

02:27.120 --> 02:27.710
Huh?

02:28.080 --> 02:30.120
We're Kaitous.

02:30.670 --> 02:32.840
Eevn if we're not invited...

02:32.840 --> 02:34.130
...we'll find a way in.

02:34.130 --> 02:36.590
Man, that was cool!

02:43.100 --> 02:44.510
Let's go, Maron.

02:44.510 --> 02:45.430
Okay.

02:49.940 --> 02:52.360
Hmm, they're right for each other!

02:54.900 --> 02:59.360
You, Become God's Wind!

03:08.160 --> 03:09.080
Let's go.

03:21.930 --> 03:24.180
They're finally showing themselves.

03:24.180 --> 03:25.510
Looks like it.

03:25.510 --> 03:27.560
There's an enormous number of them!

03:40.360 --> 03:42.410
Let's have ourselves a little fun.

03:42.410 --> 03:43.530
Okay.

03:44.370 --> 03:45.490
<i>Game Start!</i>

04:27.070 --> 04:28.160
Jeanne, look out!

04:30.370 --> 04:31.580
<i>Checkmate!</i>

04:36.330 --> 04:37.460
I'm not going to thank you.

04:40.630 --> 04:41.300
Chiaki!

04:48.260 --> 04:49.510
<i>Checkmate!</i>

04:53.890 --> 04:55.020
I'm not going to thank you.

04:57.770 --> 04:59.020
This is pointless.

04:59.020 --> 05:00.610
They just keep on coming.

05:00.610 --> 05:04.610
But we have to <i>Checkmate</i> them all, or we won't be able to advance.

05:04.610 --> 05:07.570
I've got it! Fin-chan is up there...

05:07.570 --> 05:09.620
...in the highest room!

05:09.620 --> 05:11.410
- This is great.

05:10.790 --> 05:11.410
- Huh?

05:11.410 --> 05:13.660
This is where a man can show off!

05:13.660 --> 05:16.290
Maron, you'll be even more in love with me.

05:16.290 --> 05:18.750
What are you talking about at a time like this?!

05:18.750 --> 05:21.380
Leave this to us and go on ahead.

05:21.380 --> 05:22.130
Chiaki...

05:22.130 --> 05:24.630
I'm leaving Fin-chan to you, Jeanne!

05:24.630 --> 05:26.010
Access...

05:26.010 --> 05:28.050
"I'm not going to thank you," right?

05:33.560 --> 05:34.600
Here's your "thank you."

05:37.980 --> 05:39.360
Thank you, Chiaki!

05:44.820 --> 05:47.820
All right, come at me whenever you want!

05:47.820 --> 05:50.620
I'm fired up right now!

06:05.050 --> 06:06.300
<i>Wait for me, Fin!</i>

06:06.300 --> 06:08.340
<i>I'm definitely coming for you!</i>

06:11.390 --> 06:14.600
You're giving it everything you've got, Maron...

06:14.600 --> 06:17.640
...like a fool.

06:17.640 --> 06:19.480
For such a long time...

06:20.150 --> 06:21.940
<i>Nice to meet you, Maron!</i>

06:21.940 --> 06:24.150
<i>I have to tell you something.</i>

06:25.860 --> 06:26.740
<i>Fin...</i>

06:27.440 --> 06:29.610
<i>I can't become Jeanne...</i>

06:29.610 --> 06:31.200
<i>I'm scared of the night...</i>

06:31.200 --> 06:33.160
<i>I'm all alone...</i>

06:33.160 --> 06:34.240
<i>What are you talking about?!</i>

06:34.240 --> 06:38.540
<i>You have me! I'm always with you!</i>

06:38.540 --> 06:39.540
<i>Fin...</i>

06:42.000 --> 06:47.210
I know Maron the best...

06:47.630 --> 06:50.010
I can't do it, really! I can't be a thief!

06:50.010 --> 06:52.390
<i>You can do it, Maron!</i>

06:52.390 --> 06:55.100
<i>Really? Can I believe that?</i>

06:55.100 --> 06:58.140
Angels never lie.

06:58.560 --> 07:00.690
<i>I can...believe that, right?</i>

07:02.230 --> 07:04.650
You can believe that, Maron.

07:11.990 --> 07:15.240
Now, open the door...

07:18.040 --> 07:20.250
<i>The Door of Despair...</i>

07:33.890 --> 07:34.680
This is...

07:34.680 --> 07:36.970
Maron?! Is that you, Maron?!

07:38.020 --> 07:40.310
It <i>is</i> you, Maron!

07:40.310 --> 07:41.770
Welcome home!

07:42.190 --> 07:44.480
M-Mom...

07:44.480 --> 07:45.770
- Welcome home, Maron.

07:46.610 --> 07:48.780
We've been waiting for you.

07:48.780 --> 07:50.320
Dad...

07:50.320 --> 07:54.030
You did well! You've worked very hard!

07:54.030 --> 07:57.830
Being Kaitou Jeanne must have been hard work.

07:57.830 --> 08:00.040
You...knew?

08:00.040 --> 08:01.710
There's no way we wouldn't know!

08:01.710 --> 08:03.330
It concerns our own daughter.

08:03.330 --> 08:05.420
That's right, dear!

08:12.170 --> 08:14.430
You saved the world.

08:14.430 --> 08:17.050
You don't have to be Jeanne anymore.

08:17.050 --> 08:20.720
I was in agony! I was so lonely!

08:20.720 --> 08:22.810
Everything is all over.

08:22.810 --> 08:26.730
Now you can live your own life.

08:26.730 --> 08:30.730
That's right. You don't have to push yourself for anybody else.

08:30.730 --> 08:33.700
Let's all go our separate ways.

08:33.700 --> 08:34.700
Huh?

08:34.700 --> 08:38.200
Now we can really get a divorce!

08:38.910 --> 08:43.000
But... You two weren't getting along because of the Devil...

08:43.000 --> 08:44.620
The Devil had nothing to do with it.

08:44.620 --> 08:48.630
Even if he didn't exist, we can't go back to how it was.

08:48.630 --> 08:54.590
We forced ourselves to be together because of you, but you'll be fine on your own now.

08:55.510 --> 08:56.890
No...

08:58.850 --> 09:01.100
We'll never be able to see each other again, but...

09:02.600 --> 09:05.060
...we'll keep sending you money.

09:07.600 --> 09:09.480
Was it my fault?

09:11.400 --> 09:13.610
Was it because of my existence?

09:15.610 --> 09:18.200
Would it have been better if I hadn't been born at all?!

09:18.200 --> 09:20.490
I've thought about that from time to time...

09:20.490 --> 09:22.790
...but it's not like it matters now.

09:26.870 --> 09:28.210
I...

09:47.900 --> 09:48.980
I'm...

09:50.110 --> 09:51.900
...all alone.

10:00.160 --> 10:04.700
Oh, my. The Rosario is all gone...

10:04.700 --> 10:09.210
You'll never be able to transform into Jeanne again, Maron.

10:09.210 --> 10:10.000
Fin...

10:10.000 --> 10:12.000
Poor Maron.

10:13.840 --> 10:16.260
Weak and lonely Maron.

10:16.260 --> 10:18.880
Crybaby and solitary Maron.

10:18.880 --> 10:21.890
You couldn't do anything if I wasn't there, Maron.

10:22.510 --> 10:26.770
But, there <i>is</i> one good thing about your pathetic self:

10:28.850 --> 10:30.980
Your crying face, Maron!

10:30.980 --> 10:34.940
It's so disgusting, pitiful and pathetic... I love it!

10:37.990 --> 10:38.900
Fin!

10:39.860 --> 10:43.530
Try to remember...your true feelings...

10:43.530 --> 10:45.490
My true feelings?

10:51.540 --> 10:55.590
Regain...your true self...

10:55.590 --> 10:56.760
Please...!

10:59.840 --> 11:01.890
What are my true feelings?

11:01.890 --> 11:03.600
What is my true self?

11:03.600 --> 11:06.930
What do you know about me?

11:07.560 --> 11:10.890
Have you stopped to consider that this <i>is</i> my true self?

11:10.890 --> 11:16.940
No, the Fin you are right now isn't the real Fin I know.

11:22.660 --> 11:25.280
My name is Fallen Angel Fin Fish.

11:25.280 --> 11:29.870
I vow loyalty to the Devil, and I hate God from the bottom of my heart.

11:30.830 --> 11:32.960
That <i>is</i> the true me.

11:34.290 --> 11:36.300
Don't worry, Fin.

11:36.300 --> 11:40.090
I'll change you back to normal.

11:40.090 --> 11:43.300
That's why... I won't cry anymore!

11:43.300 --> 11:45.140
So sickening...!

11:47.890 --> 11:49.600
Try it if you can!

11:51.140 --> 11:53.980
What are you going to do?! Scream?! Pray?!

11:56.230 --> 12:00.190
I know, Maron! Ask God for help.

12:00.190 --> 12:04.780
Since you say "In the name of God," why don't you call Him?

12:05.200 --> 12:09.250
But it's no use! God won't do anything! He can't do anything!

12:10.080 --> 12:12.710
There are only three things that God can do:

12:12.710 --> 12:19.210
He can create souls, watch over those souls, and control the Earth's environment.

12:19.210 --> 12:21.840
A God that just watches over you isn't a God!

12:26.300 --> 12:30.560
Fin, what do you want from God?

12:30.560 --> 12:31.480
What?!

12:31.480 --> 12:35.190
Would you be happy if God just fulfilled your wishes?

12:35.190 --> 12:37.980
Would you be satisfied if He just gave you happiness?

12:39.400 --> 12:42.650
Do you just want to stay on the receiving end?

12:42.650 --> 12:45.410
Do you just want to live a life of waiting?

12:45.410 --> 12:48.660
Aren't you just asking for a relationship of being loved?

12:48.660 --> 12:50.080
Shut up...

12:50.080 --> 12:52.500
That's not living at all.

12:52.500 --> 12:54.580
Shut... Up...!

12:54.580 --> 12:57.000
You're not living because someone told you to...

12:57.000 --> 12:59.880
We're living because we want to live!

12:59.880 --> 13:03.590
We don't need to believe in God or the Devil.

13:04.760 --> 13:06.550
We can believe in ourselves...

13:16.560 --> 13:18.230
I'm impressed that you could say all that.

13:18.230 --> 13:20.980
The one living a life of waiting was...

13:20.980 --> 13:23.780
...the one asking for a relationship of being loved...

13:23.780 --> 13:26.490
...Maron,

13:24.820 --> 13:26.490
that was you!

13:28.160 --> 13:31.910
You were just waiting for a simple letter from your parents, every single day.

13:31.910 --> 13:36.790
Because Chiaki loved you, you just had him protect you whenever you were in trouble...

13:36.790 --> 13:43.840
You just relied on my powers, on Jeanne d'Arc's powers and on God's powers!

13:43.840 --> 13:47.630
Have you even once done anything with your own strength?!

14:00.400 --> 14:02.610
I can't do anything...

14:05.280 --> 14:06.990
I'm all alone...

14:07.860 --> 14:11.450
Poor girl. Poor Maron...

14:11.450 --> 14:15.870
You were fooled by my lie and acted like some protector of justice.

14:15.870 --> 14:20.830
But it's all over now. Kaitou Jeanne has disappeared from this world.

14:21.290 --> 14:22.710
Therefore...

14:23.090 --> 14:25.260
Kusakabe Maron is...

14:25.260 --> 14:26.380
...no longer needed!

14:35.140 --> 14:35.850
What the...?!

14:47.070 --> 14:48.320
Access...

14:49.450 --> 14:50.700
Maron!

14:50.700 --> 14:52.820
Maron! Pull yourself together!

14:53.950 --> 14:56.500
Access! How dare you get in the way?!

14:56.500 --> 15:01.710
Whoa there! Don't get the wrong idea! I didn't do it to save Jeanne.

15:01.710 --> 15:03.630
I did it to protect you.

15:03.630 --> 15:04.590
What?!

15:04.590 --> 15:09.260
If you hurt Jeanne now, you'll be sad once you turn back to normal.

15:09.260 --> 15:10.590
What kind of stupid...

15:10.590 --> 15:13.350
I believe in you, Fin-chan!

15:13.350 --> 15:16.010
Then, die believing!

15:20.270 --> 15:22.100
Damn you, Access!!!

15:22.940 --> 15:25.610
Chiaki! Right now, I'm entrusting Maron to you.

15:25.610 --> 15:26.860
Maron!

15:32.490 --> 15:34.370
I'm...

15:34.370 --> 15:35.870
...all alone.

15:36.290 --> 15:37.870
Maron! Hang in there!

15:38.290 --> 15:40.040
All alone...

15:41.170 --> 15:44.420
Maron! Maron! Look at me!

15:45.290 --> 15:46.040
Who am I?!

15:47.670 --> 15:49.170
Chiaki...

15:49.170 --> 15:52.470
That's right! I'm always by your side!

15:53.470 --> 15:56.970
I'm... All alone...

15:56.970 --> 16:01.940
You're wrong! You're not all alone! Try to remember!

16:02.190 --> 16:06.900
Who's outside waiting for you because she believes that you'll be back?!

16:08.280 --> 16:11.360
<i>I understand...! I'll trust you and stay here!</i>

16:11.360 --> 16:13.240
<i>Please come back!</i>

16:14.360 --> 16:15.530
Miyako...

16:15.530 --> 16:17.330
That's right, Miyako!

16:17.330 --> 16:21.870
Then, who died, entrusting everything to you and letting fate decide her life?

16:23.210 --> 16:30.460
<i>Maron, please go back to your time, and change your important Fin back into a pure Angel.</i>

16:32.880 --> 16:34.930
<i>By meeting Kusakabe Maron,</i>

16:34.930 --> 16:38.310
<i>I was finally able to turn back into a normal man.</i>

16:39.430 --> 16:43.230
<i>M-Maron... You are my wind...</i>

16:43.230 --> 16:46.480
<i>I was able to become stronger because of you.</i>

16:47.860 --> 16:49.570
Jeanne d'Arc...

16:50.570 --> 16:52.030
Noin...

16:52.030 --> 16:53.490
Zen-kun...

16:53.490 --> 16:56.780
That's right! You're not alone!

16:56.780 --> 16:58.870
You have me! You have Miyako!

16:58.870 --> 17:03.290
There are Jeanne d'Arc, Noin and Takazuchiya Zen! We're all watching over you!

17:03.290 --> 17:04.710
But you...!

17:05.040 --> 17:08.460
What are you going to do if you don't believe in yourself?!

17:08.460 --> 17:12.090
Believe in...myself...

17:12.090 --> 17:14.510
That's right! You have to believe in yourself!

17:15.430 --> 17:16.890
Believe...

17:20.470 --> 17:21.770
...in myself.

17:21.770 --> 17:22.810
<i>- Kusakabe Maron.</i>

17:24.430 --> 17:30.860
<i>Right now, you must listen to your heart, and decide on what you really want to do.</i>

17:33.440 --> 17:36.530
I'm going to believe in myself.

17:36.530 --> 17:41.030
Even if I'm weak, lonely, or can't do anything...

17:42.080 --> 17:44.960
I'm not all alone.

17:44.960 --> 17:48.460
I... I love myself.

17:49.790 --> 17:56.800
And I love all the people around me that I believe in and those who believe in me!

18:01.140 --> 18:03.060
<i>Now stand up, Maron.</i>

18:03.060 --> 18:06.350
<i>And start walking with your own strength!</i>

18:09.270 --> 18:11.270
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

18:12.360 --> 18:14.230
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

18:15.280 --> 18:18.110
Energetic and courageous!

18:18.200 --> 18:22.280
God's breath becomes the wind and breezes through all things.

18:22.280 --> 18:25.910
<i>That wind is gentle, fierce and sometimes becomes wild.</i>

18:25.910 --> 18:28.670
<i>But it will never disappear.</i>

18:28.670 --> 18:33.420
<i>It watches the sea, the sky, and it is in harmony with the forests and mountains.</i>

18:33.420 --> 18:35.590
<i>Is the wish either healing or commanding?</i>

18:35.590 --> 18:38.130
<i>When the time comes, that is when its true form will come forth.</i>

18:38.130 --> 18:41.220
<i>You, Become God's Wind!</i>

18:41.390 --> 18:42.430
What the..?!

18:42.970 --> 18:44.890
She transformed without the Rosario...

18:44.890 --> 18:47.310
The Sacred Power has awakened...

18:49.980 --> 18:52.440
Hey, Fin. I've been thinking that I...

18:52.440 --> 18:53.770
Stay back...

18:53.770 --> 18:55.690
...have to become stronger.

18:55.690 --> 18:57.400
...have to become more energetic...

18:57.400 --> 18:59.530
...have to become more like Jeanne.

18:59.530 --> 19:01.410
I can't be faint-hearted...

19:01.410 --> 19:03.780
I can't be scared of the dark...

19:04.580 --> 19:05.410
Stay back!

19:05.410 --> 19:07.870
But I don't think that's it...

19:09.120 --> 19:10.370
S-Stay back...

19:10.370 --> 19:13.590
I can be weak. I can be lonely.

19:13.590 --> 19:19.300
I finally understand that the most important thing is that I can say that I love myself, no matter what I am.

19:20.720 --> 19:22.760
I love myself.

19:23.390 --> 19:24.430
Stay back...

19:24.430 --> 19:27.640
And Fin, I...

19:27.640 --> 19:29.140
DON'T SAY IT!!!

19:37.820 --> 19:39.490
I'll say it again and again.

19:39.490 --> 19:42.070
Fin, I...

19:44.660 --> 19:46.280
Don't say it...

19:53.790 --> 19:55.040
...love you!

20:37.090 --> 20:38.960
It's God's Wind...

20:38.960 --> 20:41.760
Did God defeat the Devil?

20:41.760 --> 20:42.470
Maron!

20:46.390 --> 20:49.390
You're such a liar, Maron.

20:54.190 --> 20:56.690
You said you wouldn't cry anymore.

20:58.360 --> 21:00.030
You too, Fin.

21:00.030 --> 21:01.360
I...

21:03.030 --> 21:04.200
You're right!

21:10.330 --> 21:12.790
Welcome back, Fin.

21:14.120 --> 21:16.750
I'm back, Maron!

21:16.750 --> 21:18.710
Fin-chaaaaaaaaaannnnn!!!

21:18.710 --> 21:21.880
Fin-chan! Fin-chan! Fin-chan! Fin-chan! Fin-chan! Fi...!

21:21.880 --> 21:23.880
Where the heck are you touching?!

21:23.880 --> 21:26.180
It's the very end, and this is what I get...

21:26.180 --> 21:28.390
Access, you pervert! I hate you!

21:28.390 --> 21:30.140
Access, I...!

21:32.810 --> 21:33.680
Thank you.

21:35.480 --> 21:37.650
It's hard being so attractive...

21:49.660 --> 21:52.080
Well then, let's go home!

22:13.640 --> 22:16.140
Geez! Hurry up, Maron!

22:16.140 --> 22:17.690
We're going to be late!

22:17.690 --> 22:20.690
What? The mail box again?!

22:28.610 --> 22:35.200
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.670
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.050 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.780 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.540 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.130
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.
